{#
 Detail of the « staff_photos » step of the Année scoute workflow (chantier #930),
 written as the content of the step's Détails dialog. Receives `step`
 (Core\ScoutYear\Step\TransitionStep) and reads only `step.details`,
 `step.pendingMessage` and the step itself; the keys of `step.details` are
 documented on Core\ScoutYear\Step\Check\StaffPhotosStepCheck. The points to
 check, the actions and who marked the step are rendered by the page
 around this file, never here. Owned by the step checks (lot E); the page
 and the Détails dialog that include it are not.
#}
{% if step.pendingMessage %}
<div class="alert alert-info small py-2 px-3 mb-2" role="note">{{ step.pendingMessage }}</div>
{% endif %}
{% if step.details.section_count is defined %}
<p class="small mb-2">
    {{ step.details.with_photo_count }} {{ step.details.with_photo_count <= 1 ? 'section' : 'sections' }} sur
    {{ step.details.section_count }} {{ step.details.with_photo_count <= 1 ? 'a' : 'ont' }} une photo de groupe de l'année.
    {%- if step.details.missing is not empty %} Manquantes : {{ step.details.missing|join(', ') }}{% endif %}.
    La photo de l'an dernier, qui s'affiche encore, ne compte pas.
</p>
{% endif %}
